{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Scan area and move to object. Pick up if within reach, then check properties or do specific task. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectInView    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    />\"",
